{"id":8887,"date":"2023-12-20T10:25:38","date_gmt":"2023-12-20T15:25:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8887"},"modified":"2023-12-22T13:01:23","modified_gmt":"2023-12-22T18:01:23","slug":"getting-in-the-spirit","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2023\/12\/20\/getting-in-the-spirit\/","title":{"rendered":"Getting in the Spirit"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Last night we took up the offer from our friend Heidy to come on down to her home at Green Valley.  We met Heidy a few years ago when we and she were both members of the <a href=\"https:\/\/mexicanconnection08.com\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/mexicanconnection08.com\/\">Escapees RV Club Chapter 8 Mexican Connection<\/a> trip.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Since Heidy&#8217;s kitchen is kind of torn apart for new paint and countertops, we all had supper at one of her favorite local family-owned restaurants and then drove on up to Tucson to visit the <a href=\"https:\/\/tucsonbotanical.org\/lightsup\/\">Tucson Botanical Gardens<\/a> for their holiday light display.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The weather was perfect, in the 50&#8217;s and the hour or so we spent there walking through the gardens was beautiful.  The gardens opened at 6 pm and admittance was by prepaid tickets at specific times.  This way large groups came in at staggered times as the previous group(s) left.  I&#8217;d say they let in about 300-400 visitors at a time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s a gallery of pictures and videos.  We talked with one of the employees and he told us that many of the larger trees take weeks to install all the lights and they have to remove them every year so as not to grow into the bark.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Many of the lights changed color as you walked through and many others were timed to coincide with the music that played throughout the gardens.  It was a great way to enjoy the holiday and reminisce about how we&#8217;ve spent Christmas pasts.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8871\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1850497832536535818297033-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8871\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1850497832536535818297033-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1850497832536535818297033-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1850497832536535818297033.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8874\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1848443606938697768298829-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8874\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1848443606938697768298829-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1848443606938697768298829-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1848443606938697768298829.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8872\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1819588979664428393809232-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8872\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1819588979664428393809232-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1819588979664428393809232-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1819588979664428393809232.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8873\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833145146844987387945430-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8873\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833145146844987387945430-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833145146844987387945430-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833145146844987387945430.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8870\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833565019523369156901575-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8870\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833565019523369156901575-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833565019523369156901575-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1833565019523369156901575.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8876\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1819498654334658662233039-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8876\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1819498654334658662233039-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1819498654334658662233039-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/202