_181749445143905053270604.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8879\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1817532069117735103315203-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8879\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1817532069117735103315203-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1817532069117735103315203-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1817532069117735103315203.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8882\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816342685997524528610326-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8882\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816342685997524528610326-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816342685997524528610326-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816342685997524528610326.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8881\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816196593616626916562405-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8881\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816196593616626916562405-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816196593616626916562405-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1816196593616626916562405.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8880\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1814142032720971310898466-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8880\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1814142032720971310898466-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1814142032720971310898466-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1814142032720971310898466.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8883\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1812343915087211455847655-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8883\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1812343915087211455847655-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1812343915087211455847655-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1812343915087211455847655.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" data-id=\"8885\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1810454530853377595600488-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8885\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1810454530853377595600488-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1810454530853377595600488.jpg 405w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8884\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759091941258911391087652-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8884\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759091941258911391087652-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759091941258911391087652-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759091941258911391087652.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" data-id=\"8886\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759023531317638873757638-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8886\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759023531317638873757638-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759023531317638873757638-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/20231219_1759023531317638873757638.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Right now we&#8217;re all up and showered enjoying our morning coffee and a little later this morning were going to head over to the <a href=\"https:\/\/gvwhiteelephant.com\/\">Country Fair White Elephant<\/a>, a local resale shop to see what kind of goodies they might have that would work either in our new rig in Arizona or the house back in Ohio.  Now that we&#8217;ve decided to keep the house for our summer home, we will be more comfortable with spending some on furnishings and decorating.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I was too awe struck to think about taking any pictures of the White Elephant resale shop in Green Valley, Arizona south of Tucson.  It&#8217;s a huge building where they must have at least 40 volunteers on duty every day of the week.  The parking lot was packed, probably a hundred or so cars and this was on a TUESDAY!  Heidy told us it&#8217;s like this every day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>All of the &#8220;merchandise&#8221; is sorted\/grouped by type; furniture, rugs, tools, shoes, sports equipment, etc.  If you find an item you like, just flag down one of the roaming clerks (who are very friendly and helpful by the way) and they&#8217;ll write up the item, lead you to the check out counter where you pay for the item(s), and then one of their &#8220;pickers&#8221; moves your purchases to the loading dock where you&#8217;ll have them loaded for your trip home.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Heidy found a great little solid walnut drop-leaf table.  It&#8217;s got a drop leaf on each side so when it&#8217;s folded it&#8217;ll go in her hallway and only take up a space about 1 foot by 3 feet.  The spindle legs are lathe-turned and fold out to support the table on all four sides.  It looks like something that was made in the &#8217;30&#8217;s or &#8217;40&#8217;s.  Once Heidy gets it cleaned up, it&#8217;ll be a wonderful addition to her home there in Green Valley.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignleft size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Drop-Leaf-Table.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"506\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Drop-Leaf-Table.jpg\" alt=\"Heidy's table is similar to this one except that hers has rectangular leafs\" class=\"wp-image-8892\" style=\"width:299px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Drop-Leaf-Table.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Drop-Leaf-Table-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Drop-Leaf-Table-685x456.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Drop-Leaf-Table-342x228.jpg 342w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>Heidy&#8217;s table looks similar to this one I grabbed off Google Images except that hers has rectangular leafs instead of half-round.  That way her table is square when it&#8217;s opened instead of round.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The special thing about this store is that all of the items are donated and the $1,500,000 plus annual sales are donated to local charities and food banks.  It&#8217;s quite an operation and it&#8217;s fun to see how everyone there (buyers and volunteers alike) are having such a good time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/gvwhiteelephant.com\/about-us\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/gvwhiteelephant.com\/about-us\/\">Here&#8217;s the link to their &#8220;About&#8221; page on their web site<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Since we only took the Lexus down to her place, once we fit the table in the trunk there wasn&#8217;t a whole lot of room left, but we did manage to push in a cute little lamp we bought for $10<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignright size-medium\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Table-Lamp.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Table-Lamp-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8894\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Table-Lamp-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Table-Lamp.jpg 405w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>along with a western style hat for Kathy ($6) that&#8217;ll fit her just fine for our upcoming &#8220;Western Days&#8221; here at the park along with a pretty large wall hanging ($25) that&#8217;ll be a nice accent to the living room area rug and loveseat that are in our home back in Mt Gilead.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As we drove away I joked (maybe not) to the girls that if\/when we come back next year I&#8217;ll rent a U-haul! <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"alignleft size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/moving-truck-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"269\" height=\"188\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/moving-truck-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8896\" style=\"width:401px;height:auto\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A night at Heidy&#8217;s turned into a Tucson adventure! From glowing gardens to treasure hunting at the local White Elephant shop, the excitement was real. Heidy found a vintage gem, and we squeezed it into the Lexus. Who knew a $6 hat and a $25 wall hanging could make our day? Maybe a U-haul is in our future!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[586,677,554708197,19546,554707329],"tags":[24592,554708204,554708199,554708202,554708207,554708205,127613,554708203,554708198,554708133,554707704,554707660,554708201,554708206,554707656,554707298,554708208,554708209],"class_list":["post-8887","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-food","category-friends","category-shopping","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-arizona","tag-clothing","tag-country-fair","tag-donation","tag-drop-leaf","tag-drop-leaf-table","tag-escapees","tag-furniture","tag-green-valley","tag-heidy","tag-herbnkathy","tag-herbsells","tag-resale-shop","tag-table","tag-tucson","tag-volunteer","tag-wall-hanging","tag-western-hat"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8887","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8887"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8887\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":8900,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8887\/revisions\/8900"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8887"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8887"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8887"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}